Description: Package management services for Apple TV on RootHide custom firmware
 The on-demand root daemon and the installer Irisin uses on Apple TV:
 packages are installed natively and apps are registered with the system,
 without dpkg. Draft: the Apple TV is managed over the network in a later
 release.
